{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demented deity has taken up residency on Mars. Spacetime is warping and Mars has turned both flat and round. Your mission is to harvest its divine organs. But be prepared, a god has many minions. Fight through millions of mutant demons to claim the relics of the god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Looping Mars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/loopWorld_32_9.gif?t=1742319362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a looping Mars and find its secrets and challenges. Complete them and be rewarded with powerful relics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hordes of Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/horde_32_9.gif?t=1742319362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight enormous swarms of demonic mutants while never slowing down. Jetpack above them, ski around them or soar through the sky to avoid their rage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/nuke_32_9.gif?t=1742319362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tear through the terrain with an arsenal of futuristic weapons. Burn through rock and flesh with screeching beam weapons. Fire mountain-rising grenades or enormous nukes that obliterate everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551170?t=1742319362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/23154d8585a4d6c4685de664b654cfdbbc1807f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742319362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/9917af983ac2ec31a80bfccd2591cd57ae3ce072/ca